      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solomon%2C_Arizona",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A railroad once linked Solomon with the Southern Pacific at Bowie Station, connecting the town to regional trade.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
