      ],
      "source": "https://genealogytrails.com/ariz/graham/history.html",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The area that became Graham County was once part of Dona Ana County in New Mexico Territory, spanning a high desert that reached the Colorado River.",
